{"articles":[{"id":"7768298d-71b3-4421-abdf-be54abf1e2c1","title":"从零了解伊斯兰","excerpt":"各位亲爱的朋友，大家好！今天，我们相聚在这里，一同探索世界上拥有十多亿信众的伊斯兰教（الإسلام），从最基本的字面概念到它的历史发端与核心要义。对于一些从未接触过宗教，或者对伊斯兰仅有片面印象的朋友来说，这也许是一个新奇而神秘的领域。那么，我希望在这篇分享里，能够用浅显易懂的语言，带领各位走进那片广袤又深邃的信仰天地。","cover_image":"https://kbnkixakgfaejakqlqtt.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/article-images/be72bef2-eb4f-40a3-9cf3-673a14cfa3da/1778573115566.jpg","cover_focal_y":27,"excerpt_enabled":true,"is_pinned":false,"is_featured":false,"view_count":120,"like_count":0,"comment_count":0,"published_at":"2026-05-12T08:06:18.632+00:00","updated_at":"2026-06-11T15:22:41.26706+00:00","video_url":"","author":{"id":"be72bef2-eb4f-40a3-9cf3-673a14cfa3da","username":"22ww","avatar_url":"https://kbnkixakgfaejakqlqtt.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/avatars/be72bef2-eb4f-40a3-9cf3-673a14cfa3da/1776865544845.jpg","role":"admin","badge_text":""},"category":{"id":"481f6dc4-ac83-4b43-b373-27f4e2f30688","slug":"culture","name":"伊斯兰文化"}},{"id":"bbf078ef-012c-48ee-8e1b-f54629e24f2a","title":"怎么回事？","excerpt":"","cover_image":"","cover_focal_y":50,"excerpt_enabled":false,"is_pinned":false,"is_featured":false,"view_count":65,"like_count":0,"comment_count":0,"published_at":"2026-05-03T13:33:38.293+00:00","updated_at":"2026-06-11T14:19:28.531488+00:00","video_url":"https://kbnkixakgfaejakqlqtt.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/article-videos/be72bef2-eb4f-40a3-9cf3-673a14cfa3da/1777815169573.mp4","author":{"id":"be72bef2-eb4f-40a3-9cf3-673a14cfa3da","username":"22ww","avatar_url":"https://kbnkixakgfaejakqlqtt.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/avatars/be72bef2-eb4f-40a3-9cf3-673a14cfa3da/1776865544845.jpg","role":"admin","badge_text":""},"category":null},{"id":"2acbd31e-48e3-4940-82ec-5a379fadfdc0","title":"团结的力量","excerpt":"","cover_image":"","cover_focal_y":50,"excerpt_enabled":false,"is_pinned":false,"is_featured":false,"view_count":48,"like_count":0,"comment_count":0,"published_at":"2026-05-03T13:31:54.004+00:00","updated_at":"2026-06